  "backstory": "Torvin grew up in a small village that was constantly raided by bandits. At a young age, he enlisted in the local militia, quickly rising through the ranks due to his natural aptitude for combat. He fought in several skirmishes, witnessing the brutality of war firsthand. While skilled, he became disillusioned with the constant violence and left the military seeking a quieter life, though his past continues to haunt him.",
  "flaws": [
    "Haunted by memories of the battlefield.",
    "Quick to anger when innocent people are threatened.",
    "Distrustful of authority figures."
  ],
  "ideals": [
    "Strength. I must be strong to protect those who cannot protect themselves. (Good)",
    "Responsibility. I do what I must and face the consequences. (Lawful)"
  ],
  "bonds": [
    "I still send money home to support my family.",
    "I am seeking revenge on the bandits who destroyed my village."
  ],
  "traits": [
    "I am always polite and respectful, even in tense situations.",
    "I can stare down a hellhound without flinching."
  ],
